From bc0dd8a296dbf7faff587f52a996a713cee3d962 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Lane A <lane-a@local.invalid>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:25:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 19/22] feat(reaction): face-led candidates for face-carried
 moments (REACTION_FACE_LED)

Sanji Q2/Q7: YuNet at 10 Hz (5 Hz past 30 min) on the facecam, per
second p90 mouth-corner width and head jump, both / face height, z per
task. A run at z >= 4 for >= 2 s that no reaction already covers is a
face_reaction candidate: capped at 45 alone, up to 55 with a coinciding
game event. Switch REACTION_FACE_LED (default on).

Fixture v2, literally: R2 mouth z 1.7, jump z 1.1 (raw pixels: mouth
50.9 px vs 51.0 px in a calm window); no run fires anywhere, so R2 is
still missed and the decoy stays out (mouth z 0.3, jump z 2.4). Slate
unchanged: 6/7 checks. 43 reaction tests pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
